          "Caption": {
            "Id": "VPfvJc",
            "Content": "Description"
          },
          "Text": "Neuron selection searches for a network size that balances model fit and generalization.\nThe neuron selection algorithm is responsible for finding the optimal number of hidden neurons in the network. "
        },
        {
          "Type": "Text",
          "Title": "Neuron selection algorithm",
          "Id": "rgRYwT",
          "Content": "The growing neurons algorithm selects the optimal number of neurons in the network.\n"
